    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>1</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>chown</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Changes a file’s owner and group</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>sudo chown alice:devs file.txt</tt></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>2</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>df</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Shows free and used disk space for each filesystem</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>df -h</tt> (<tt>-h</tt> gives human-readable sizes)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>3</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>du</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Shows how much space files and folders use</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>du -sh myfolder</tt></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>4</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>kill</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Sends a signal to a process, usually to stop it, using its PID</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>kill 1234</tt> (or <tt>kill -9 1234</tt> to force it)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>5</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>man</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Opens the manual page for a command</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>man ls</tt></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>6</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>whoami</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Prints the username you’re currently logged in as</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>whoami</tt></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>7</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>sudo</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Runs a command with administrator (root) privileges</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>sudo apt update</tt></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>8</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>wc</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Counts lines, words, and characters in a file</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>wc -l file.txt</tt> (lines only)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>9</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>tar</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Bundles files into an archive, or extracts one</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>tar -czf backup.tar.gz folder/</tt> to create, <tt>tar -xzf backup.tar.gz</tt> to extract</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>10</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>ping</tt></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Tests whether another machine or website is reachable</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'><tt>ping -c 4 google.com</tt> (sends 4 packets)</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>

